    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44109" root="&#xA;                        نقل&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقْلُ الأَقْدَامِ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>The shifting of the feet from place
to place.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَآءُ النَّفْلِ</span>
                        <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَآءُ التَّعْدِيَةِ</span>
                        <i>The</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ب</span>
                        <i>that
renders a verb trans.;</i> as in <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَهَبَ بِهِ</span>. (Mughnee
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِ</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّآءُ لِلنَّقْلِ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الهَآءُ لِلنَّقْلِ</span> means
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِلنَّقْلِ مِنَ الوَصْفِيَّةِ إِلَى الاِسْمِيَّةِ</span>, i. e. <i>The</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span> that
is added <i>for the transference</i> of a word <i>from the
category of epithets to that of substantives;</i> as
in <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلِيفَةٌ</span>, accord. to some, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَائِرَةٌ</span>.

